# Global Popup + Dropdown Styling (Theme-first)

These standards apply **any time a popup, dropdown list, tooltip popover, or picker is requested**.

## Non-negotiable: Theme-first colors

- Do **NOT** hard-code hex colors for popup/dropdown styling.
- Use the app’s theme tokens / CSS variables:
  - **Surfaces**: `bg-card`, `bg-popover`, `bg-[rgb(var(--brand-rgb)/0.95)]`
  - **Borders**: `border-border`, `border-[var(--brand-strong)]`
  - **Text**: `text-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`
  - **Selected / primary accent**: `bg-[var(--cta)] text-[var(--cta-foreground)]`

If a special highlight is required (e.g., “month has data”), prefer a theme token. If using orange, keep it minimal and consistent: `border-orange-400/90` (no hex).

## Popover primitive (required)

- Use the shared wrapper: `@/components/ui/popover` (`web/src/components/ui/popover.tsx`).
- **Interactive popovers must set `modal`** to prevent “flash open then close” in overlays/modals.
  - Good: `<Popover modal open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>`
  - Tooltip-only popovers can be non-modal.

### Focus safety (required)

- **Interactive popovers must not steal focus on close** (prevents “focus bounce” where typing/clicking stops working after using a filter popover):
  - Add `onCloseAutoFocus={(e) => e.preventDefault()}` on `PopoverContent` for any popover that contains inputs/checkboxes/buttons/scroll areas.
- **Tooltip-only popovers should not steal focus either**:
  - Add `onOpenAutoFocus={(e) => e.preventDefault()}` and `onCloseAutoFocus={(e) => e.preventDefault()}` on tooltip `PopoverContent` when hover/focus tooltips are used near inputs.

## Trigger styling contract (dropdown/picker openers)

Use this visual language for any clickable trigger that opens a popup/dropdown:

- **Base**:
  - `rounded-lg`
  - `border border-white/15`
  - `bg-card/70`
  - `ring-1 ring-white/10`
  - `cursor-pointer`
- **Hover**:
  - `hover:bg-card hover:ring-white/15`
- **Focus**:
  - `focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[var(--brand-strong)]`
- **Disabled**:
  - `disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50`
- **Icons**:
  - Action icon (calendar/clock): `text-[var(--cta)]`
  - Chevron: `text-muted-foreground`

## Popover panel styling contract (dropdown content)

For interactive dropdown panels:

- **Container**:
  - `rounded-2xl`
  - `border border-[var(--brand-strong)]`
  - `bg-[rgb(var(--brand-rgb)/0.95)]`
  - `shadow-xl`
  - `backdrop-blur-md`
- **Scrolling**:
  - `max-h-[280px] overflow-y-auto`
- **Widths (intentional sizing)**:
  - Year dropdown: `w-[120px]`–`w-[140px]`
  - Generic select dropdown: `w-[240px]`
  - Time dropdown: `w-[220px]`

## Option row styling contract

- **Selected**: `bg-[var(--cta)] text-[var(--cta-foreground)]`
- **Hover**: `hover:bg-[var(--brand-strong)]/50`
- **Typography**: `text-sm font-semibold`

## Scrollbar styling (required; vertical + horizontal)

Any time you introduce a scroll container (e.g. `overflow-y-auto`, `overflow-x-auto`, `overflow-auto`) inside a popup/dropdown/modal/picker:

- **Use theme-first scrollbars** (no hex colors): rely on the global scrollbar styling in `web/src/app/globals.css`.
- **Prefer adding the explicit class** `ymca-scrollbar` on the scroll container to document intent and keep consistent styling across browsers.
- **Support both directions**: if horizontal scrolling is possible, keep `overflow-x-auto` and ensure the container uses the themed scrollbar as well.

## Use approved components (avoid native widgets when panel must be themed)

- Prefer `PopoverSelect` for dropdown lists:
  - `web/src/components/ui/popover-select.tsx`
- Prefer `TimePicker` over `<input type="time">` when you need a themed dropdown panel:
  - `web/src/components/ui/time-picker.tsx`
- Prefer `MonthYearPicker` for month selection (no day grid unless explicitly needed):
  - `web/src/components/ui/month-year-picker.tsx`

## Month/Year picker specifics

- Month grid: `grid grid-cols-3 gap-2` (3×4)
- Selected month: `bg-[var(--cta)] text-[var(--cta-foreground)]`
- Month with existing availability/data: `border-orange-400/90` (token-safe)

## Copy/paste snippets

### Standard dropdown (PopoverSelect)

```tsx
import { PopoverSelect } from "@/components/ui/popover-select"

<PopoverSelect
  value={value}
  options={options}
  onChange={setValue}
  ariaLabel="Select option"
/>
```

### Time picker (TimePicker with range constraints)

```tsx
import { TimePicker } from "@/components/ui/time-picker"

<TimePicker
  value={startTime}
  onChange={setStartTime}
  ariaLabel="Start time"
  stepMinutes={15}
  minTime={branchTimeStart}
  maxTime={branchTimeEnd}
/>
```

### Month/Year picker (MonthYearPicker with highlighted months)

```tsx
import { MonthYearPicker } from "@/components/ui/month-year-picker"

<MonthYearPicker
  value={month}
  onChange={setMonth}
  highlightedMonths={monthsWithData} // ["YYYY-MM", ...]
/>
```

